# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF Go
# files and `gofmt -l` reports every file in the repo as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
